held, owner handed out: they name the expected roots: true
held: then the sibling is accepted: true
dropped: the owner is reclaimed: true
dropped: the owner cells still name it, the live-root scan no longer does: true
dropped: the sibling is refused, naming the owner: true
uncollected: the sibling is refused, naming the owner: true
